  "scope": [
    "One private preloaded subject-reader library, no new public data envelope, serializing copies or candidate execution. Existing source/contract/definition/graph consumers support complete single-root and Skill/code subjects; pure-call keeps its distinct pure-only scope.",
    "New Skill-interface declaration check uses shared recursive/export-shape checks; preserves boolean/number distinctions, exact association agreement and typed export declarations without blanket equality of implementation exports/schemas.",
    "Actual PG sealed pairs in both primary orders and changed/context forms, raw source extraction, no candidate execution, compatible extra declarations, invalid metadata/roles/duplicates/version/context, re-entry and draft/operator preservation exercised in Monty.",
    "Existing actual contract/preload/source inventory/structure/pure flows and global embedded/base/Sempai consumer pass; new dependency closure pins are real, prior assertions retained.",
